>> title: Avgolemono
>> category: Soups
>> tags: chicken, lemon, eggs, greek, rice
>> counters: Shawarma Counter, Diner
>> aka: egg-lemon soup, chicken lemon rice soup, kotosoupa avgolemono, Greek lemon chicken soup
>> pairs-with: pita-bread
>> servings: 6
>> time: 40 min
>> slack: unforgiving — this is egg and lemon tempered into hot broth and it curdles the moment it boils, which no whisking or straining undoes; it is also why the pot never goes back on the heat once the egg is in, and why it cannot be reheated the next day
>> step.1: simmer 18 min
>> step.2: warm 3 min
>> step.3: whisk until frothy
>> step.4: temper, stir in off the heat
>> step.5: season

Simmer @long-grain rice{1/2%cup}(95 g) for ~{18%min} with @chicken stock{8%cups}(1.9 L) and @kosher salt{1%tsp}.

Warm @&(~1)soup{} for ~{3%min} with @shredded cooked chicken{2%cups}(280 g).

Whisk @eggs{3%large} with @lemon juice{1/3%cup}(80 mL) until pale and frothy.

Temper @&(~1)egg mixture{} with a ladleful of @&(~2)hot soup{}, then stir it back into the pot off the heat.

Season @&(~1)soup{} with @dill{2%Tbs} and @black pepper{1/2%tsp}.
